# wallet.rules - common/setup_dg_wallet.sh
Enter new wallet password \(protects the wallet file\):	@WALLET_PASSWORD@	secret
Confirm wallet password:	@WALLET_PASSWORD@	secret
Enter existing wallet password:	@WALLET_PASSWORD@	secret
Type 'RECREATE WALLET' to replace it, or press Enter to [^:\n]*:	RECREATE WALLET
